  "ID": "46129",
  "post_title": "La entrada gratis llena el Recinto Multiusos en la Pascua Taurina de Onda",
  "post_date": "2014-04-23 15:32:06",
  "post_name": "la-entrada-gratis-llena-el-recinto-multiusos-en-la-pascua-taurina-de-onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El Recinto Multiusos de Onda se ha llenado por completo la tarde de este martes para presenciar el desaf&iacute;o local entre las ganader&iacute;as La Se&ntilde;ora y Mas de Pere, dentro de la XXI Pascua Taurina.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_5100.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">El espect&aacute;culo se tuvo que suspender la noche del s&aacute;bado por la lluvia y la entrada era gratuita, por lo que ha atra&iacute;do a gran cantidad de personas.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/deafiamentlocalramaderiespasquataurinaonda14/img_5100.jpg\" alt=\"img_5100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/deafiamentlocalramaderiespasquataurinaonda14/img_5101.jpg\" alt=\"img_5101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/deafiamentlocalramaderiespasquataurinaonda14/img_5102.jpg\" alt=\"img_5102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/deafiamentlocalramaderiespasquataurinaonda14/img_5104.jpg\" alt=\"img_5104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/deafiamentlocalramaderiespasquataurinaonda14/img_5106.jpg\" alt=\"img_5106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/deafiamentlocalramaderiespasquataurinaonda14/img_5107.jpg\" alt=\"img_5107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/deafiam